#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""GENESIS — the system's entry point.

  genesis "<ask in your own words>"
      The door. Genesis answers, and runs what he needs to run to answer
      honestly. You do not need to know any of the names below.

  genesis --help        this list
  genesis chat          a conversation
  genesis --card        Genesis's character card
  genesis --tools       what he can run
  genesis prompt        the chat prompt — editable, and live when written
  genesis codexify      the Codexify install — provisioned and verified

Plain words, if you would rather not ask:

  genesis identity        the identity constant
  genesis plan            the 2031 arc
  genesis vocabulary      the symbolic forms
  genesis pattern         the numergram
  genesis compare A B     two moments, composed
  genesis now             the grounding stamp for this moment
  genesis meaning         what the symbols mean
  genesis safety          is the reality intact
  genesis readings        the position on identity and the singularity
  genesis check           verify the system

Standard library only. The network is touched only under --probe.
"""
